<title>JAPAN: Nomura had no other irregular deals -- Sakamaki.</title>
<headline>Nomura had no other irregular deals -- Sakamaki.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura Securities Co Ltd had no involvement in any irregular stock deals other than those with a client linked to a &quot;sokaiya&quot; racketeer, Nomura's former president Hideo Sakamaki told a parliamentary committee on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
